id: pm-rlm-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T22:26:21.144Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T03:43:43.368Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T22:26:27.464Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T22:40:35.908Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 36/36, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. This package has no npm trusted publisher: releases remain red at the OIDC step until the owner configures the publisher for this repository and release.yml. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-19T02:04:21.552Z",codex-sol,"Daily Release candidate PR #77 for 2026.10.18 failed with Live publication identity disagrees. npm published at 2026-10-26T10:44:38.602Z before trusted preparation at 2026-11-16T11:42:34Z. No attestation, tag, GitHub Release or recorded workflow publication attempt exists for this intent. The protected merge matches the receipt. Read-only replay at c46a241 returns occupied and retains the historical receipt on retirement. Pin the shared workflow to v2026.11.18 with existing inputs and permissions."
  "2026-11-19T02:09:36.389Z",codex-sol,The linked release caller contract and changelog check both passed. Rollout is pending review and scheduled reconciliation.
  "2026-11-19T03:43:42.468Z",codex-sol,"Updated docs/release-caller-rollout.md to the pm-ops v2026.11.18 caller SHA c46a2419c63af3b348e6b559b0733ab0d9942cc7. Pinned the package-side pm-ops dev dependency and lockfile to 2026.11.18 (previously 2026.11.14). With tags fetched, npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. The caller tests passed 6/6, the linked documentation contracts passed 117/117, and npm run typecheck passed."
